{"id":"75b33efb6ea67912","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Perfect Information Game","display":"df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game — ZFC Game4 Perfect Information Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game — ZFC Game4 Perfect Information Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game — ZFC Game4 Perfect Information Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in V\">\\(H\\in V\\)</span> (candidate set of finite histories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (move set) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in V\">\\(N\\in V\\)</span> (nonempty player set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span> (player-to-move function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(h,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(h,X)\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(P,H\\setminus T,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(P,H\\setminus T,N)\\)</span> (player-to-move function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S\\)</span> (perfect-information game-form predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}information\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S(H,N,P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,T\\;\\Bigl(\nH\\subseteq\\{h:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(h,X)\\}\\land\\emptyset\\in H\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\}\\;(h\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\bigr)\\land\nN\\neq\\emptyset\\land\nT=\\{h\\in H:\\neg\\exists v\\in H\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(v)=\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\}\\land\nv\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(h)=h)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(P,H\\setminus T,N)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}information\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S(H,N,P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,T\\;\\Bigl(\nH\\subseteq\\{h:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(h,X)\\}\\land\\emptyset\\in H\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\}\\;(h\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\bigr)\\land\nN\\neq\\emptyset\\land\nT=\\{h\\in H:\\neg\\exists v\\in H\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(v)=\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\}\\land\nv\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(h)=h)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(P,H\\setminus T,N)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}(h,X)$ (finite-sequence predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(P,H\\setminus T,N)$ (player-to-move function, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":fal